Set colour, brightness and **Effect** inside each **Day / Cosy / Night Light**. **Override Light** and **Lamps…** use the same schedule.

{% set overrides = state_attr('sensor.ls_overrides', 'overrides') or {} %}
{% set ns = namespace(names=[]) %}
{% for record in overrides.values() if record.get('kind') == 'light' %}
{% set ns.names = ns.names + [state_attr(record.target, 'friendly_name') or record.target] %}
{% endfor %}
{% if ns.names %}
**Temporary House overrides are active for {{ ns.names | count }} {{ 'lamp' if ns.names | count == 1 else 'lamps' }}.** Schedule changes are saved and take effect when those overrides end.

{{ ns.names | join(' · ') }}

[Manage overrides in House](/house-lights/lights)
{% else %}
House changes temporarily override these scheduled settings.
{% endif %}
